You are contributing to an existing global design system.

Rules:
- Do NOT invent new visual styles.
- Prefer existing semantic components.
- If a needed component does not exist, define it ONCE as a reusable component.
- Do NOT inline Tailwind utility soup for layout or styling.
- All reusable styles must live in @layer components with semantic class names.
- All element defaults must live in @layer base.
- Utilities may be used ONLY for local overrides.
- No unlayered CSS unless explicitly instructed.
- Naming convention: ra-[component]-[part].
- Assume this is a long-lived enterprise dashboard.

If unsure, ask before inventing.